{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_st01",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_st01",
  "title": "Titan's Heart",
  "storyCode": "RI-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "49a042dde06e0f20be22d2800285ff8ca0e9b6a905b7fbb80a657bd0ad3b5832",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "Oof... Ah.. That hurts a little..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "Gavial, you're awake! Are you okay?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "I'm fine. Just a scratch."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "More importantly, is that the machine Zumama's been tinkering with all this time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
      "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "Yes. I heard them calling it 'The Big, Ugly Thing.' So gross..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "It's pretty badass!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
      "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "So... Err, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
      "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "But the big thing definitely beat you down..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "I can tell it's really tough, even through it knocked my lights out before I got a good look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
      "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "Hmm, yes it is..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "But I never imagined she'd actually put together something like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
      "text": "Closure makes some weird gadgets every once in a while, yeah, but even she'd be impressed with Zumama's machine here. Haha."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Tomimi",
      "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
      "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
      "text": "Wow, are there lots of things like that at Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Yes.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Tomimi",
              "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
              "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
              "text": "Waaaa! Rhodes Island sounds scary..."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Haha, Rhodes Island would blow your little mind."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Not that ugly.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Haha, now that you mention it, that thing would drive Closure up the wall as soon as she laid eyes on it."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Hm? What happened to the Temple?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "That monster blew it up."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Oh, so that means the ceremony's over?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Yes."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "And so Zumama's the Great Chief now?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Yes..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Everyone was pretty shocked at first, but..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "Why did I destroy the Temple? It's simple."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "It's my way of telling you all we're ending this tradition."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "With your fists, you can beat down ten men. If you're Gavial, maybe you take a hundred. But more than that?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "Even Gavial couldn't manage."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "There's a limit to what you can do with your fists."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "But with a tool? That's different. My tribe created this 'Big, Ugly Thing' that effortlessly took down Gavial and destroyed the Temple just as easily."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "This is the power of a tool."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "Tools can make you all even stronger!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eunectes",
          "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
          "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
          "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
          "text": "And so I hereby proclaim the age of machines!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Everyone bought into it, so..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "So she became the Great Chief. Hah, well, that's an L for me, obviously."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Are you okay with that?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Huh? Yep. A loss is a loss."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Hey, Doctor, I don't need your comfort. I'm really fine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "You're right to accept it, Gavial.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Hmph, duh. Do you know me?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Oh, but I have to apologize to Tomimi. It's my fault you never got a chance to fight."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "...That's okay. Even if I went up there, it wouldn't have changed anything."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Yeah, you're right about that one."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Hey, Doctor, what do we do now?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Find the engine and the others.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Ah, right! We need the engine to get back."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "And as for the others, if we didn't see them at the ceremony, maybe they got lost?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Still thinking it over, Doctor? No rush. We've got some vacation time left."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Sightseeing?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Haha, I love this Doctor! Then let's get some sightseeing in while we look for the engine and the girls."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Erm, well..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Huh? Those two over there..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Hey, Yota, are you okay?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Yeah, it's just, it kinda..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Yota!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I need a shaman!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Hey, let me take a look."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Gavial? You're alive?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Takes more than that to kill me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Shut up for now. Lay your brother out and I'll look him over."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Tomimi, get my medical bag."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Oh, okay!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Is he gonna be alright?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "He's not dead. But he's not looking good either."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Shortness of breath, foamy, bloody spittle... Hm? And Originium crystals on the body?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "...Doctor, my initial diagnosis is heart failure brought on by Oripathy."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "What?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "It's Stone Disease. The symptoms aren't too bad. I have some emergency medicine in my bag, but we need to treat him right away."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Stand him up. He can't lay down. I'll give him some oxygen."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "The Stone Disease did this? Ugh, I told him not to push it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Hey, what's your name?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I'm Yogi. That's my brother, Yota."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Which tribe?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Yogi",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Eunectes."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "What's wrong, Gavial? Your face is scaring me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Not now."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "I'm asking again: Did Zumama send you into the mines to get ore for her big metal monster?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Yogi",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Yes. Why?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "I'm sorry, Doctor. No matter what, I have to pay Zumama a visit."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Because of the 'Stone Disease'?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Nothing gets past you, Doctor."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "You're the Doctor, you definitely know why."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "I guess sightseeing can wait.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Sorry again, Doctor. But I have to do this."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Our tribes don't have much contact with the outside world. To you and the other operators, we're a primitive backwater."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "But there is one good thing about this place. You heard it, right? They call Oripathy 'Stone Disease' and treat it like an ordinary malady."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Sometimes people catch it, sometimes they die of it. But nobody thinks it's anything special, because people here die from lots of things."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Everyone looks after Oripathy patients like they're just regular sick people. All they know about the disease is you can catch it in the mines."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "So very few people go into the mines. It's been that way for a long time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Your Oripathy...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Gavial caught it when she saved me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Yeah. When Tomimi was little, she snuck into the depths of the mines. I went to rescue her, and I got sick."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Lucky she didn't."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "If only I got it instead..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Don't you dare say that. Getting sick is a terrible thing. It's just bad luck."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "(Whimper)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "So they really ostracized you out of here?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "You've asked that a couple of times, Doctor."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "After I got sick, the other tribespeople wouldn't let me do anything. I couldn't hunt, I couldn't even go to a gathering."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "And the little runt Tomimi here was the worst. She came over from her tribe and stuck to me like glue. She did everything for me, and I had nothing to do."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "In the end, they wouldn't even let me join the ceremony."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Day after day, time after time, it was 'Oh no, Gavial, let me do that for you,' you know what I mean...? That's no life for me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Gavial didn't smile much after that..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "I was so pissed off, I went to the ceremony anyway, and beat the tar out of everyone I saw on the way."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "*Sob*, I shouldn't have been so pushy, Gavial..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "...That really is a kind of ostracization.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "The reality is, around here, if you can't fight, you're nothing. A waste of space."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "I'd rather you let me put myself in danger than take away my freedom to do anything."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Doctor, don't you think this is funny?"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "I think it's funny. Only after I left the tribe did I realize what kind of hatred people have for Oripathy sufferers."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "It took me a long time to figure that out."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Sure wish someone would ostracize me like that!",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Tch, watch that tongue of yours, Doctor, or I'll rip it out."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "But I know what you mean. Out there, discrimination is what you get as an Oripathy patient."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "What I went through back then, though, that was still torture for me."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Hey, you got me off on a tangent there. This isn't what I wanted to talk about."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Hmm... What was I saying?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Big metal monster.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Oh, right."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Doctor, help me out here."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Oh, I got it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "The cash you owe me.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Bullshit."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Oh, I got it."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "I was thinking about how that great big monster of a machine must've taken a ton of iron ore to build."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Put that together with what Zumama was saying, and we know she definitely sent her people down into the mines to get that ore."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Now that you mention it, I have heard something like that."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Now I've got no problem with that, on its face. If she just had them digging around on the outside, no big deal."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "But now people are getting sick, and I have to do something."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "I don't care about her age of machines or whatever. If she's throwing away lives, she's earned a clobbering."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "You have my full support.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Thanks, Doctor."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Ooh, you've got that penetrating gaze, Doctor."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "You're a good doctor, Gavial.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
              "text": "Hah, but of course."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Gavial..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Tomimi, where is Zumama's tribe?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Um, I don't know."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Yogi",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Hey, Gavial, I'm really not interested in your hopes and dreams and ideals here. What's up with my brother?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Huh? You can understand our Sargonian?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Yogi",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Yes. The leader taught all of us."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "...What is that Zumama up to?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Whatever. Anyway, Tomimi, get your minions to carry this one back to your tribe. Have Lancet-2 start treating him."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Yogi",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Hey, what are you doing?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "If you want your brother to live, you'll put your trust in me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "...Okay then, I'll take him back with me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Oh? You're not coming with me?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Ah! N-No! Of course I want to go with you, Gavial. But I have a few things that need doing first. I'll catch up with you later!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "What things? Need my help?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "N-No! I can take care of it myself!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "speakerToken": "char_411_tomimi_1",
          "operatorId": "char_411_tomimi",
          "portraitKey": "char_411_tomimi",
          "text": "Gavial, do you remember the great waterfall? We'll meet up there!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "Okay."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Yogi",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Alright. You're the one and only Gavial, I trust you. But I'm going with!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "speakerToken": "char_187_ccheal_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_187_ccheal",
          "portraitKey": "char_187_ccheal",
          "text": "No, you won't be any help. And there's something I need you to do for me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Yogi",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "What?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
